 e the launch with artist and Black Hero’s Journey co-curator Eric Battle
 \, writer Christopher Benson\, Director of Abrams ComicArts imprint Megasc
 ope John Jennings\, and leading comics scholar Qiana Whitted.\n\nhttps://w
 ww.creativephl.org/arts-event/framing-emmett-till-exposing-dark-fear/
