SUMMARY:Network for New Music presents DANZAS DEL ECUADOR
DESCRIPTION:Network returns to the Teatro Esperanza to present this electri
 fying program of music by Ecuadorian composer Jorge Oviedo. The program fe
 atures the premiere of Jorge Oviedo’s KAWSAY\, commissioned in part by N
 etwork for New Music. Taking its title from the Kichwa word for “life”
  or “existence\,” KAWSAY is a five-movement suite drawing upon Ecuador
 ian and Andean musical traditions\, including Caipishca from Saraguro\, Ya
 raví\, Pasillo\, Amor Fino\, and Raymi polyphonic music. The program also
  features…\n\nhttps://www.creativephl.org/arts-event/network-for-new-mus
