  - June 25th\, 2026)\n\nPAFA is honored to present Al Gury: Painting and P
 urpose\, an exhibition celebrating the legacy of the beloved painter\, edu
 cator\, author\, advocate\, and friend.\n\nFor more than 38 years\, Al sha
 ped the life of PAFA with extraordinary dedication\, generosity\, and care
 . A PAFA alumnus and Cresson Traveling Scholarship recipient\, he returned
  to the Academy as a teacher and became one of its most enduring voices in
 …\n\nhttps://www.creativephl.org/arts-event/al-gury-painting-and-purpose
