DESCRIPTION:Who Do You Think You Are? \n\nAn audience immersion\, one woman
  show that will take you on a journey into the origin story of Rose Love\,
  born with a voice and a dream. But then\, as with many\, life intrudes. "
 Reality" sets in\, and her voice gets silenced\, but not completely. With 
