SUMMARY:W Philadelphia Pours + Prose
DESCRIPTION:Pours + Prose is a new initiative happening at W Philadelphia o
 n Wednesday evenings in June. This fun alternative to CCD Sips is a reimag
 ined happy hour for literature lovers\, wine sippers\, and vibe seekers.
  \n\nWhen: Wednesdays starting June 4\, running from 5-8 PM\n\nWhere: W P
 hiladelphia’s WET Bar\n\nEach week\, Vine Street Imports will be shari
