SUMMARY:Art Mindfulness: Gardens & Galleries
DESCRIPTION:Gardens & Galleries: Art & Mindfulness is a guided cultural wel
 lness experience curated by Lauryn’s Garden in partnership with Philadel
 phia galleries and creative spaces.\n\nThis immersive program invites part
 icipants to explore artwork before and after a guided mindfulness session 
